notes.content:
//mish changes
- Unsanctified Crypt map: Some of the contraption spots have been moved up a bit (so there's less of a big empty space at the top of the map).

//bug fixes
- If a large enemy activated a Mimic Treasure Chest by moving into it then it would cause a crash.
- Mausoleum Awakens - Unsanctified Crypt map: In Architect Mode you couldn't place contraptions.

//misc changes
- The game engine has been updated to the latest version of GameMaker (v2023.8.1).

//bug fixes
- Translation files weren't loading their data correctly.

//bug fixes
- Potted Planties relic: The pots were REALLY eager to see you.
- Tamed Snake Wyrm minion: It was possible for it to be Hasted which would look rather weird.

//bug fixes
- When using full Mouse Support the Boneraise screen would cause a crash (ahh classic!)
- Crypt Hub: When using the Bookcase opening and closing the Achievements menu or Minion Boneways would prematurely close the background menu.

//bug fixes
- When using full Mouse Controls the game could crash when offered a Boneraise.
- Accursed Tome of Antiquities/Sorceries relic: This wasn't triggering a Curse.

//bug fixes
- Brodacious Brozilla minion: The silly sausage could cause a crash when in his Pot form.
- Boneworld Challenges: When playing as Psycho Possessed the class possession wasn't being correctly seeded.

//misc changes
- Snipe Pistoleer minion: Increased his attack Damage to 40 (from 30).

//bug fixes
- Sacrilegious Summonings spell: This was causing a crash when cast.
- Castle Conquest: Some special events could trigger during the stage end sequence (eg rumble texts, enemy bounty spawns, etc).

//misc changes
- Castle Conquest: Stage 10 will now always have a Roaming traveller event at the start of the stage.
- Compendium - Minion Boneways: Changed the Behemoth Excavator pathway so it's consistent with how other minions show.

//bug fixes
- Raising a Berry Bro could cause CHAOS as it was mucking up the current map variable (notably causing issues in Castle Conquest and with achievements).

//bug fixes
- King Gigald: Spawning the Shade Mini-Boss could cause a crash.
- Mini-Boss Veterans meta: The level colouring was wrong.

//bug fixes
- If you carried Soul/Leechen Blade relics then the Ghost Boners created by a Giantan Summoner would cause a crash if they attacked an enemy.
- The Manic Mime minion could mime a temporary minion which could destroy itself.

//bug fixes
- The Minionous Mortis meta had the unfortunate side effect of making you immortal.
- The Lunatic Fanatic on some maps would spawn in the top terrain.

//bug fixes
- Closing the Boneraise Lore or Heroic Force screens would cause a crash.
- Fixed a "beaat" typo.
